WEBVTT

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:50.440
You, the guided one who
holds the same wish...

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.540
...my powers have been frozen,
so lend me yours.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:57.580
You incurred the gods' wrath and
have been in such a predicament.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.490
What more are you trying to do now?

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:03.490
You should know,
if we are of the same mind.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.390
Belldandy!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.630
Belldandy?

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:58.440
About 4:30 a.m. Today an emission of light
was observed on the moon's surface.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.420
- Belldandy?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:02.010
- This phenomenon was witnessed
by many observatories...

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.490
...and specialists say the origin
is still unknown.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:06.480
Belldandy?

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.930
Do you know where Belldandy is?

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.460
It's so beautiful...

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:25.060
I wonder why my sister can do
everything so well.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:28.970
She's a Goddess with a First Class License
with no restrictions.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.340
So it's no surprise.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.200
If only I could sing like that...

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:35.870
First, you'd need to find
a wonderful love.

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.280
What, are you saying
you can sing like that?!

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.450
This withered tree has sprouts
coming out of it.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:54.320
Your powers are amazing, Belldandy.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.400
No, the tree spoke to me.

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:02.660
It said it wanted to live here in the forest
a little longer, with the other living things.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.240
Those feelings of the tree have
given it a new life.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:10.670
I only lent a small helping hand, that's all.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.110
Keiichi.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.840
Didn't you come here looking
for Belldandy?

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.710
Oh, right!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.880
Belldandy, I want to leave a bit early today.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:21.950
Sure.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:28.990
Skuld, if you want to, we could practice
singing together later on.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.030
Really?!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.840
It's wonderful to be able
to sing well.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.390
But the thing that counts is taking
the listeners' feelings into consideration...

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:39.500
...and showing that you care,
through your song.

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.140
If you have those feelings, then
everything will turn out fine.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.750
Thank you, Sister!

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.360
Skuld sure looked excited.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:05.200
When I was young, I had a kind of
mentor to teach and guide me.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:10.060
I'd like to do as much for her, if I can.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.530
Really?

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.670
I'd like to meet that mentor of yours.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:16.650
Okay.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.010
Sister!

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.740
See you later!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.340
Bye!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:37.260
This is the third spring since
you've come here.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.730
Guess it's natural to be nervous.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:42.890
Attention freshmen and returning students.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:48.940
I'd like to thank you for coming today
to the Motor Club's welcoming ceremony.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:55.040
Through motor sports, we the Motor Club
members try to learn about friendships...

00:07:55.180 --> 00:08:00.170
...effort and will power in order to make
our campus life more meaningful.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:04.310
Now, if everyone would please step
back behind the pylons.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:07.220
We would like to demonstrate
a few of our activities.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.720
Let's begin!

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:11.550
Huh...?

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:15.060
Um, uh...

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.230
I beg your pardon!

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:22.130
All these vehicles have run in many races...

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:26.300
...and have set some
very impressive records.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.430
With these machines...

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:30.780
...we hope to deepen our friendships
with many other teams...

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.910
...and have a really good time;
that's our motto!

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.910
Additionally, at the event next week
in Shizuoka...

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:41.720
...the Motor Club will participate
with the help of "World Wind."

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.980
And this is the bike that
will run the race!

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.650
What do you say?

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:15.210
Will you join our club and help us
expand the activities of...

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:15.920
Huh...?

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.090
Are you looking to join, perhaps?

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:22.030
Thank you very much!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:28.030
And our first new member is... a girl!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.270
Now then...

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:37.880
Attention everyone!!

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:42.850
We are the Old Boys of
Nekomi Tech's Motor Club!

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:49.190
We're like, totally blown away
that you came here for us today!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.890
Tamiya and I, Otaki, are studying at
the graduate school of this university.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:59.900
Any time and anywhere, we can
help you out with our fiery spirits!!

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:01.700
No probs!

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:06.310
Good, healthy bodies always
house the spirits!

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:10.040
So, come with us! Together we'll
light the fires inside you...

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:13.670
...and build up the hard bodies
that house them!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:17.210
Become a star of motor sports!

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.650
And get a big bang out of life!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:26.320
So you blew the chance to get
more club members?

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:30.930
What's with you two?!
Why do you always do this?!

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:37.770
But I suppose that means these people here
are the true, hard-core motor sports fans.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.770
That's right!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.810
You are the chosen ones!

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:47.610
We share the same happiness and
pain and will carry on together!

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:52.210
We welcome you with open arms!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.600
You don't like this kind of party?

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:06.260
Don't worry; they look pretty weird,
but they're basically good guys.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:14.140
You must be interested in motor sports,
seeing as you joined the club.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.440
Do you have a motorbike or a car?

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.480
Nope. Not really.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.410
Hey, Morisato!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:25.550
You already have Belldandy, and you're
trying to pick up the new club member?!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.590
Hardly!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.990
She just looked bored by herself, that's all!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.430
The new members seem pretty nervous.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.390
It reminds me of when I first joined.

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.270
I didn't have a clue what to do.

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:44.930
I was very nervous, too, but had
all kinds of dumb aspirations.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.530
They'll be fine.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:51.770
They'll experience lots of things here
and think of them as great memories.

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:55.880
Every one of them has a good heart
that enables them to do that.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.440
Maybe in the future I'll...

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.990
Belldandy!

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:04.990
So, you were in here, huh.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.730
You're up next.

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:10.160
Here.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.500
Are you all right?

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:19.800
Sure, I'm fine.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:26.380
Belldandy's so lucky!

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:31.550
She's pretty, and nice, and smart...

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:35.780
Not to mention her great cooking
and knock-out figure!

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:36.790
Megumi...

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:42.230
She seems so perfect!

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:45.260
You'd better look after her real good!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.170
Come off it, you've gotta drive home!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.670
Give that to me!

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:49.470
Keiichi!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.160
Huh...?

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.700
Everyone says I look like a junior
high student, that I'm puny...

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.570
...a kindergarten student and stuff...

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.580
Nobody goes that far.

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:00.080
They do so!

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.240
But even so... even so...

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.690
Look, my boobs are this big!

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:12.890
Okay, I'll show them to ya!

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.190
Hey, I never asked to see them!

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.430
Well, what do ya think?

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.830
Snap out of it, Hasegawa!

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:27.940
Uh, I'm...

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.740
I'm so sorry!

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:01.440
Sorry.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.640
I shouldn't have used my powers
back there.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.010
Forget it...

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.910
Spring's just about over this year.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:15.620
Next year, and the year after,
and ten years from now...

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:19.830
I'd like to spend all my springs
with you, Keiichi.

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:10.110
I'm coming!
Jeez, what lousy timing!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.110
Hello, Morisato residence.

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:16.050
It's been a long time.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:19.680
Oh my, to what do I owe this pleasure?

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.480
If it's about a wish, then I don't
need one right now.

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:26.850
I wouldn't get hold of you
for something like that.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.690
No?

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.230
Then what is it?

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.700
Someone set loose a man...

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:36.800
...who was under eternal incarceration
in the Luna Dungeon.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:41.710
Word is that he might be headed that way.

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:44.640
I don't even know what's going on...

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:53.580
Get me a Popsicle while you're out!

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:10.030
Celestin!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:20.240
You haven't changed; still quick to cry.

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:23.620
You've grown even more beautiful, though.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.620
Much more beautiful than before.

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.600
Keiichi, I'll introduce you.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:40.770
This is my mentor, Celestin.

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.900
He's taught and guided me for
many years since I was a child...

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:48.170
...so I could become a Goddess First Class.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:50.480
Hi.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:53.240
This is Keiichi Morisato.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.420
I live with him here on Earth.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.810
So what brings you here?

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.520
Or did you just come here to see me?

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:08.520
Last time, you just disappeared
so suddenly.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:12.590
Where've you been all this time?!

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.340
I...

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.310
I thought as much.

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.370
You don't remember anything.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:27.010
I came to get you.

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.180
Celestin!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:38.920
Urd...!

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:43.960
You've got nerve, showing up here!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.760
You haven't changed, either.

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.700
Get away from Belldandy!

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:53.210
But Urd, he's...

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:54.210
Move!

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:56.110
Don't, Urd!

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.220
What did you do to Belldandy?!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.260
Belldandy! Belldandy!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:28.140
You've taken good care of her, haven't you?

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.810
But I want to give it one more try.

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:36.580
I want to give Belldandy one more
chance to choose her path.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:45.760
Urd!

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:49.700
Belldandy isn't waking up!

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:51.790
Belldandy!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:56.530
Unknown virus penetrated from
Satellite 6, moving at a terrific speed!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.700
Reaching the gate! About to break through it!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.110
What is it?

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.640
We're still trying to determine that.

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:04.940
Level Four auto diagnostics sequence!

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:07.040
What about the emergency protector?

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.410
No good, it's not working.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.510
This is no good!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:16.150
Judging by the route it's taking, I'd say
the virus is headed for the main system.

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:19.550
The output of Satellite 6 dropped by 20%!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.960
Stay calm.

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.060
Ere, you cancel the main protocol.

00:19:24.400 --> 00:19:28.460
Ex, you run a simulation test on
that virus route and block the line.

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:32.370
Chrono, you eliminate the virus
trapped behind the wall.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.670
Yes, Ma'am.

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:37.810
Why is the fugitive doing this...?

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:43.980
What the heck happened?!

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:45.780
That's what I'd like to know!

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.720
It seems like a spell's been cast on her.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:01.670
What on earth...?

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.730
What is it?!

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:08.700
We've gotta do something...

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:10.910
I'll try.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:21.960
Who the hell is that guy?

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:24.650
Urd!

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:29.920
Hello?

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.770
Hello?

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:36.500
Can you hear me?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.530
I can hear you, Urd.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:45.040
Someone has used Belldandy's network
to let a virus enter our system.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:46.710
What happened down there?

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:50.680
The man in question came into contact,
and that's when it all began.

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.820
Right now we're shutting down
the network...

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:56.520
...and trying to stop further invasion.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.620
So we can't bring Belldandy there
for treatment?

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:02.020
Not now!

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:04.570
We mustn't come into contact with
the infected person.

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:05.930
So no backup...?

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.090
Until we can get this virus under control...

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:11.200
...keeping this phone line secure
is the most we can do.

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:15.970
We'll finish as soon as we can,
and then we'll treat Belldandy.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:21.000
Until then, I want you to follow
the man who did this.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:24.510
You make it sound so simple.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.850
I'm asking because I believe in you.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:30.520
I'm praying for the best.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.260
This is really starting to get ugly.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:42.800
I'm going back into the heavens
to ask someone for help!

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:50.770
Isn't Belldandy well?

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.410
It seems like this is out of our control.

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:56.580
It's cold!

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:59.120
Why isn't the gate opening?!

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:01.880
The gate's locked right now.

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:06.790
We won't know what kind of effect
his spell has on her...

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.120
...until she regains consciousness.

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.540
Celestin!

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:24.870
Keiichi?!

00:22:33.190 --> 00:22:34.350
Belldandy.

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.150
Belldandy.

00:22:58.050 --> 00:22:59.270
What's going on?!

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:00.540
Don't look!

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:23.430
My name is Belldandy, and I've come
from the Goddess Relief Office.

00:23:25.810 --> 00:23:29.680
I'm here to make your wishes come true.

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:32.870
But you can wish only once.

00:23:34.820 --> 00:23:38.010
Uh, I'd like to ask you something...

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.950
Why is Skuld here at your house,
Mr. Morisato?

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:45.120
And Urd, too...

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:49.030
Because you came to make
Keiichi's wish come true...

00:23:49.100 --> 00:23:52.830
...and you didn't return for so long,
so we...

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:54.430
I've been here?!

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:58.470
But this is the first time
I've met Mr. Morisato.

00:23:59.740 --> 00:24:04.740
Our purpose is to assist troubled people,
such as yourself.

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:07.770
Please, tell me your wish.

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:10.240
U-Urd, do you think...

00:24:11.120 --> 00:24:14.250
Yeah, it looks like she has amnesia.

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:15.690
What?!

00:24:17.230 --> 00:24:20.660
Then how can she remember
you and me, Urd?

00:24:21.900 --> 00:24:25.700
Selective memory loss; he deliberately
erased only her memories of Keiichi.

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:28.430
Who has amnesia?

00:24:30.040 --> 00:24:32.510
We're talking about you, Sister!

00:24:33.140 --> 00:24:34.840
Come on, Keiichi! Do something!

00:24:35.340 --> 00:24:37.540
You love her, don't you?!

00:24:41.150 --> 00:24:42.080
All right.

00:24:42.150 --> 00:24:43.280
I've got it!

00:24:43.350 --> 00:24:47.250
How about I make my wish that
Belldandy's memory will be returned?

00:24:47.820 --> 00:24:50.920
I don't really understand,
but I'll give it a try.

00:24:50.990 --> 00:24:51.790
Huh?!

00:24:58.870 --> 00:25:01.600
The system doesn't seem to be responding.

00:25:02.970 --> 00:25:05.500
I'm just going to get in touch with someone.

00:25:05.570 --> 00:25:06.800
Wait a second!

00:25:07.110 --> 00:25:10.080
There's been some problems at Yggdrasil.

00:25:10.810 --> 00:25:14.980
Peorth just told me that we can't
contact them or go there right now.

00:25:15.450 --> 00:25:18.510
So she said to stay here and wait it out.

00:25:18.920 --> 00:25:20.550
Oh, I see.

00:25:22.020 --> 00:25:23.320
I'm sorry.

00:25:23.390 --> 00:25:26.190
It seems I can't grant such a big wish.

00:25:26.930 --> 00:25:31.160
But let me know if there's anything
else I can do for you.

00:25:31.970 --> 00:25:33.330
Uh, yeah...

00:25:39.370 --> 00:25:42.040
This doesn't work, either?!

00:25:42.440 --> 00:25:44.540
Man, you're giving me such a hard time!

00:25:44.610 --> 00:25:46.440
Well, I'll do it this time!

00:25:46.520 --> 00:25:49.510
Behold! The Memory Recall
Machine, "Remember", Model 2!

00:25:49.990 --> 00:25:51.710
Think it'll work this time?

00:25:51.820 --> 00:25:53.450
No problems!

00:25:53.520 --> 00:25:57.520
If you leave this to me, she'll get all
her memories back in one fell swoop!

00:25:59.130 --> 00:26:01.190
We're up to trial number 26.

00:26:01.730 --> 00:26:02.860
Whatever.

00:26:02.930 --> 00:26:04.520
Switch on!

00:26:13.340 --> 00:26:14.670
Well, Sister?

00:26:15.680 --> 00:26:17.140
I remembered something!

00:26:17.750 --> 00:26:20.940
I haven't given you my business card yet.

00:26:21.750 --> 00:26:22.880
Here you are.

00:26:25.420 --> 00:26:28.220
I'd better head off to college.

00:26:28.590 --> 00:26:31.790
I think I should cancel the race next week.

00:26:32.060 --> 00:26:34.530
Could I go with you?

00:26:35.700 --> 00:26:40.630
I'd like to see what the college
you attend is like.

00:26:41.400 --> 00:26:43.530
It must be beautiful.

00:26:44.210 --> 00:26:46.110
Well, it's not that great.

00:26:46.370 --> 00:26:49.970
Meeting wonderful professors,
and trying to better yourself.

00:26:50.580 --> 00:26:54.070
My teacher was a wonderful person, too.

00:26:54.750 --> 00:27:00.190
But right now, he's gone
to a place far, far away.

00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:04.990
I wish I could see him again.

00:27:17.070 --> 00:27:18.330
Reporting, sir.

00:27:18.470 --> 00:27:22.500
The fugitive fled to Earth and
made contact with Belldandy.

00:27:22.880 --> 00:27:27.710
The virus which entered through her
has been spreading through the network...

00:27:27.780 --> 00:27:29.750
...attacking and destroying it.

00:27:29.820 --> 00:27:32.250
Its functioning dropped by 8%.

00:27:32.820 --> 00:27:36.120
Currently we've set up a barrier
around the dummy system...

00:27:36.190 --> 00:27:37.620
...and we've stopped further invasion.

00:27:38.260 --> 00:27:42.420
While the barrier is holding up
we will eradicate the virus in Yggdrasil...

00:27:42.500 --> 00:27:44.190
...and recover the entire system.

00:27:44.270 --> 00:27:46.960
When finished, we will link Belldandy
with the dummy system...

00:27:47.040 --> 00:27:48.900
...and eradicate the main system.

00:27:49.100 --> 00:27:50.630
I approve.

00:27:50.910 --> 00:27:55.070
But we might have to use a vaccination
as well, if it comes to that.

00:27:55.310 --> 00:27:57.470
Although I hope it won't.

00:27:58.910 --> 00:27:59.880
I understand.

00:28:00.720 --> 00:28:02.010
That is all.

00:28:02.350 --> 00:28:03.320
Wait...!

00:28:04.150 --> 00:28:08.280
May I have background information
on the person who committed this act?

00:28:11.190 --> 00:28:12.160
Very well.

00:28:12.230 --> 00:28:15.290
I'll approve your right to access,
as a special measure.

00:28:15.630 --> 00:28:17.330
Confirmed.

00:28:17.400 --> 00:28:20.730
Accessing confidential file 10948.

00:28:21.840 --> 00:28:24.330
Confirming contact with Peorth.

00:28:30.050 --> 00:28:31.170
Is that...

00:28:35.050 --> 00:28:36.310
Belldandy...?

00:28:39.620 --> 00:28:42.610
Why is she...?

00:28:52.270 --> 00:28:53.600
What are they?

00:28:54.400 --> 00:28:56.100
Maybe they're shooting a film...

00:29:03.280 --> 00:29:04.250
Hey...

00:29:04.310 --> 00:29:05.540
What is it?

00:29:05.980 --> 00:29:07.740
I have a favor to ask.

00:29:08.280 --> 00:29:10.310
You mean you've made your wish?!

00:29:10.790 --> 00:29:13.190
No, it's your outfit; it stands out too much.

00:29:13.250 --> 00:29:15.780
I was wondering if you could wear
something a little more normal looking.

00:29:16.360 --> 00:29:19.890
Are you sure you want to make
that your one wish?

00:29:21.030 --> 00:29:22.550
All right then.

00:29:22.630 --> 00:29:24.560
I'll do this one on the house.

00:29:25.400 --> 00:29:26.920
Just a minute!

00:29:35.010 --> 00:29:38.140
You can't use your power when
other people are around!

00:29:38.480 --> 00:29:40.140
Is that your wish?

00:29:40.220 --> 00:29:41.980
No, I'm just saying...

00:29:42.050 --> 00:29:46.490
If people in this world find out
you're a goddess, it'll be a big mess!

00:29:46.620 --> 00:29:47.920
Oh, really...?

00:29:48.790 --> 00:29:51.990
So I'm asking you not to use
your power in front of other people.

00:29:52.460 --> 00:29:55.260
It's not my wish, it's a rule
you have to follow.

00:29:55.330 --> 00:29:56.760
Okay, I understand.

00:29:58.030 --> 00:30:01.590
No one will notice you down here,
so could you change your outfit?

00:30:02.170 --> 00:30:03.140
Right.

00:30:04.210 --> 00:30:05.190
What?!

00:30:05.310 --> 00:30:06.800
You look this way!

00:30:12.410 --> 00:30:13.940
I've changed!

00:30:17.420 --> 00:30:19.680
Is this better?

00:30:19.750 --> 00:30:21.310
That's not what I meant!

00:30:21.490 --> 00:30:22.460
Then this?

00:30:22.520 --> 00:30:23.990
No, something a college student...!

00:30:24.060 --> 00:30:25.290
Then how about this?

00:30:25.360 --> 00:30:26.290
No!!

00:30:27.260 --> 00:30:28.630
Oh, brother.

00:30:30.030 --> 00:30:31.260
Well...

00:30:45.810 --> 00:30:49.980
B-B-Belldandy has amnesia?!

00:30:51.050 --> 00:30:53.150
I'm sure her memory will
come back soon...

00:30:53.920 --> 00:30:56.580
Then who's going in the race
next week?

00:30:56.790 --> 00:30:57.620
H-Hey...

00:30:58.660 --> 00:30:59.630
Hi!

00:31:00.130 --> 00:31:01.720
Is everything ready?!

00:31:06.370 --> 00:31:07.660
What a drag...

00:31:07.740 --> 00:31:09.730
There's only 6 days till the race.

00:31:10.310 --> 00:31:13.300
And it's a mixed race, so it's not like
anyone can replace her.

00:31:14.110 --> 00:31:15.740
Sora, do you wanna try?

00:31:15.810 --> 00:31:16.940
I can't!

00:31:19.950 --> 00:31:21.920
Who can replace Belldandy...?

00:31:22.980 --> 00:31:24.540
Shall I go in the race?

00:31:41.970 --> 00:31:43.300
Do you know how to ride...?

00:31:43.370 --> 00:31:45.670
More or less, since I watched the other day.

00:31:46.270 --> 00:31:47.800
It's just like that.

00:31:47.980 --> 00:31:51.000
You can go faster or slower,
depending on the passenger.

00:31:51.550 --> 00:31:54.110
That's what makes the sidecar so much fun.

00:31:54.650 --> 00:31:59.090
In other words, the driver trusts
the passenger, and opens up the throttle.

00:31:59.920 --> 00:32:02.080
You're saying you're going to trust me, too?

00:32:02.520 --> 00:32:04.860
I have to. That's how this machine works.

00:32:05.130 --> 00:32:06.680
Here, Mr. Morisato.

00:32:06.900 --> 00:32:07.860
Thanks.

00:32:08.430 --> 00:32:11.520
I can't wait to see how you ride together.

00:32:12.000 --> 00:32:14.060
I'm sure you'll be great!

00:32:16.940 --> 00:32:18.130
Yeah...

00:32:18.210 --> 00:32:19.540
Morisato, let's get started.

00:32:22.180 --> 00:32:24.140
Don't forget to check the fuel level.

00:32:24.980 --> 00:32:25.950
Right.

00:32:40.300 --> 00:32:41.350
Let's go.

00:33:34.980 --> 00:33:35.950
Here they come!

00:33:38.850 --> 00:33:41.150
That girl's pretty good.

00:33:46.290 --> 00:33:48.260
Changing the chamber was the right thing to do.

00:33:48.330 --> 00:33:49.990
It sounded great.

00:33:50.400 --> 00:33:54.800
If you find a good partner like him,
you'll be able to do even better than now.

00:33:55.670 --> 00:33:57.970
Like Belldandy and Morisato.

00:33:58.610 --> 00:34:01.230
You mean like two lovers?

00:34:01.940 --> 00:34:03.340
Oh, we're not...!

00:34:15.460 --> 00:34:20.020
What's the connection between getting
close to those two and our goal?

00:34:20.760 --> 00:34:24.600
You just need to stick close to them.

00:34:24.900 --> 00:34:27.870
The time will come when
you'll understand.

00:34:29.100 --> 00:34:31.040
Then what'll happen?

00:34:32.070 --> 00:34:37.710
This is all to realize your wish,
and achieve my goal.

00:35:14.950 --> 00:35:16.420
I can turn...

00:35:45.450 --> 00:35:46.410
Sorry.

00:36:24.690 --> 00:36:26.810
It can be fixed, right?

00:36:27.790 --> 00:36:29.950
Yeah, I'll fix it for sure.

00:36:36.860 --> 00:36:37.690
So?

00:36:37.770 --> 00:36:39.700
It's an ongoing battle.

00:36:39.770 --> 00:36:45.210
It's already gotten in pretty deep, and there
are many parts that I can't tamper with.

00:36:46.810 --> 00:36:48.670
And take a look at this.

00:36:49.610 --> 00:36:52.010
The rhythm of the virus'
movement pattern...

00:36:52.080 --> 00:36:54.600
...is linked to Belldandy's
wavelengths.

00:36:55.350 --> 00:36:56.680
You're right.

00:36:56.750 --> 00:36:59.190
This seems to be the key.

00:37:00.050 --> 00:37:02.750
To think he stole Belldandy's
pass code so easily...

00:37:02.820 --> 00:37:05.820
...and used such a high-level virus...

00:37:06.460 --> 00:37:09.950
Do you know anything about
the person who did this?

00:37:10.230 --> 00:37:13.030
I was told, on the condition
of absolute secrecy.

00:37:13.100 --> 00:37:16.700
It's a person of high class, whose name
shouldn't be leaked, right?

00:37:16.770 --> 00:37:19.470
Does the person have anything
to do with Belldandy?

00:37:19.870 --> 00:37:22.340
I said it's highly confidential.

00:37:23.080 --> 00:37:26.710
At any rate... even though we don't know
the person's motivation...

00:37:26.780 --> 00:37:30.050
...we mustn't let him invade Yggdrasil.

00:37:30.320 --> 00:37:31.250
Right.

00:37:36.220 --> 00:37:37.710
You sure pushed too hard.

00:37:38.190 --> 00:37:40.720
But rushing things won't help.

00:37:41.060 --> 00:37:43.330
I'm not proud of what I did.

00:37:43.430 --> 00:37:45.700
Why don't you just let her see the real you?

00:37:46.670 --> 00:37:50.330
Don't forget how long
you've been living together.

00:37:52.370 --> 00:37:57.310
Trusting each other at a time like this
is what being lovers is all about, right?

00:37:57.610 --> 00:37:58.580
Yeah...

00:38:00.620 --> 00:38:02.080
What's this smell?

00:38:02.950 --> 00:38:04.540
S-Sister...?!

00:38:06.420 --> 00:38:07.410
What's this?

00:38:07.490 --> 00:38:11.860
I tried making breakfast, but
maybe I shouldn't have...?

00:38:12.230 --> 00:38:13.750
That's not the point.

00:38:13.830 --> 00:38:15.460
Hey, what's going on?

00:38:16.100 --> 00:38:17.430
Are we celebrating something?

00:38:18.570 --> 00:38:20.260
Are you mad?

00:38:20.840 --> 00:38:22.890
N-No, it's not that...

00:38:23.840 --> 00:38:30.270
If you don't eat every last bite, she might
never get her memories back of you.

00:38:35.480 --> 00:38:39.210
Um, if you're not hungry...

00:38:39.550 --> 00:38:41.580
No, this is perfect timing!

00:38:41.660 --> 00:38:43.450
I was starving!

00:38:43.620 --> 00:38:46.460
And look! All my favorite foods, too!

00:38:46.790 --> 00:38:48.460
Thanks, don't mind if I do!

00:38:52.030 --> 00:38:53.470
How is it?

00:38:53.800 --> 00:38:55.030
Terrific!

00:38:55.100 --> 00:38:56.830
It tastes just like your cooking always does!

00:38:57.410 --> 00:38:58.340
Delicious!

00:39:08.820 --> 00:39:10.650
Maybe it's the valve.

00:39:11.750 --> 00:39:13.740
Perhaps I'll ask Chihiro about it.

00:39:36.780 --> 00:39:37.840
Belldandy...

00:39:40.920 --> 00:39:44.370
I've been living in this world
all this time, haven't I.

00:39:45.120 --> 00:39:48.350
I saw the photos of you and me
smiling happily...

00:39:48.720 --> 00:39:53.320
It made me think your smile these days
seems a little empty and sad.

00:39:54.130 --> 00:39:59.500
That makes me sad, too, seeing as
it's my job to make people happy.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:04.600
So I'm going to try hard and do
what I can to make you smile again.

00:40:06.540 --> 00:40:12.450
If those photos of you and me are real,
then I want to know more about you.

00:40:13.580 --> 00:40:14.410
What?!

00:40:14.480 --> 00:40:16.140
You had an accident?!

00:40:16.220 --> 00:40:18.010
I was careless.

00:40:18.450 --> 00:40:21.980
It's like the goddess of happiness has
forgotten about you.

00:40:22.890 --> 00:40:25.190
Wanna cancel the upcoming race?

00:40:25.330 --> 00:40:27.230
I think that's a good idea.

00:40:28.460 --> 00:40:29.430
Um...

00:40:30.100 --> 00:40:34.900
If you think I can do it,
would you let me go in the race?

00:40:36.200 --> 00:40:37.570
I'll even practice.

00:40:38.340 --> 00:40:39.270
Please...

00:40:39.940 --> 00:40:42.140
Are you sure you're gonna ride with me?

00:40:47.180 --> 00:40:50.210
Chihiro, we're gonna enter the race after all.

00:40:50.890 --> 00:40:55.480
I want to try the best we can right now, so...

00:40:56.490 --> 00:40:57.580
All right.

00:40:58.790 --> 00:41:01.560
But that doesn't mean we're giving
up on winning.

00:41:01.630 --> 00:41:03.620
I still believe you'll win.

00:41:04.800 --> 00:41:07.060
That's why I'm leaving the race to you two.

00:41:20.180 --> 00:41:21.270
Excuse me.

00:41:22.420 --> 00:41:25.110
Do you know where Keiichi Morisato is?

00:41:25.490 --> 00:41:26.710
Who's he?

00:41:27.320 --> 00:41:28.520
Know him?

00:41:28.590 --> 00:41:29.680
Nope.

00:41:30.390 --> 00:41:31.480
Forget it then.

00:41:32.630 --> 00:41:35.930
Come on, show a little appreciation here.

00:41:36.830 --> 00:41:38.590
How about a coffee together...

00:41:40.000 --> 00:41:41.370
I'm done with you.

00:41:47.910 --> 00:41:50.310
The formula for the flow of fluid is...

00:41:55.480 --> 00:41:59.390
- "Ich war steif und kalt, ich war eine...

00:41:59.390 --> 00:42:01.340
- You look kind of excited.

00:42:01.340 --> 00:42:03.110
- Yes...

00:42:01.340 --> 00:42:03.110
...diesseits waren die Fußspitzen...

00:42:03.190 --> 00:42:08.690
I can't help being excited when I think
I'm going to ride that bike.

00:42:08.760 --> 00:42:13.530
...they require a certain case of noun,
just as verbs do.

00:42:13.830 --> 00:42:16.200
This rule is called prepositional...

00:42:16.270 --> 00:42:17.240
Morgan...!

00:42:17.570 --> 00:42:19.160
Be seated at once!

00:42:24.680 --> 00:42:26.840
The prof's gonna be furious,
bursting in like that!

00:42:27.080 --> 00:42:28.570
I've been looking for you.

00:42:33.650 --> 00:42:35.020
We need to talk.

00:42:48.040 --> 00:42:50.130
I want to go in the race as well.

00:42:50.200 --> 00:42:50.900
What?!

00:42:51.440 --> 00:42:54.370
She can't go in it, right?

00:42:54.680 --> 00:42:56.800
We're gonna practice, so she can go in it.

00:42:57.110 --> 00:42:58.870
Practicing will be a waste of time.

00:42:59.310 --> 00:43:01.710
We won't know until we try!

00:43:02.180 --> 00:43:05.810
Even if she has amnesia,
she's still Belldandy!

00:43:06.920 --> 00:43:11.320
Then time us both, and see which is faster.

00:43:13.490 --> 00:43:17.090
I'm in the softball club;
what do you want me for?

00:43:17.600 --> 00:43:19.500
You're the Queen of drag racing, right?

00:43:19.570 --> 00:43:21.060
Just stick with me here.

00:43:21.440 --> 00:43:23.870
Belldandy's still not better, is she?

00:43:24.040 --> 00:43:25.340
Not really.

00:43:53.270 --> 00:43:54.230
Ready!

00:44:11.620 --> 00:44:12.850
We've got it!

00:44:32.510 --> 00:44:33.600
Which is it?

00:44:33.670 --> 00:44:36.700
I think Keiichi and Belldandy might
have been slightly ahead!

00:44:43.220 --> 00:44:45.190
Morisato! Belldandy!

00:44:45.790 --> 00:44:47.650
Great job, you two!

00:44:49.020 --> 00:44:50.890
We did it, Belldandy!

00:44:50.960 --> 00:44:53.590
Yes! Yes, Keiichi!

00:44:55.560 --> 00:44:57.550
Belldandy! Belldandy!

00:44:59.730 --> 00:45:00.460
Belldandy.

00:45:01.470 --> 00:45:02.630
Belldandy.

00:45:03.640 --> 00:45:04.600
Belldandy.

00:45:05.040 --> 00:45:06.510
Yes, Keiichi?

00:45:07.510 --> 00:45:08.600
Belldandy!

00:45:09.840 --> 00:45:11.240
What happened?!

00:45:11.550 --> 00:45:16.570
I get the feeling that this has
all happened before.

00:45:17.850 --> 00:45:20.880
There were lots of people,
and I was so happy.

00:45:20.950 --> 00:45:26.020
And with me was... was you, wasn't it...?

00:45:28.760 --> 00:45:30.790
We almost had it, huh.

00:45:31.230 --> 00:45:34.530
When they're in sync, no one stands
a chance against them.

00:45:39.170 --> 00:45:41.730
I don't want to get close to
those two anymore.

00:45:42.540 --> 00:45:44.340
Why are you jealous?

00:45:44.410 --> 00:45:45.280
Jealous?

00:45:45.350 --> 00:45:48.610
I got rid of that emotion long ago.

00:45:48.680 --> 00:45:50.210
Then what is it?

00:45:50.620 --> 00:45:52.050
I don't know!

00:45:52.490 --> 00:45:55.650
Is this really going to create a new world?

00:45:56.160 --> 00:46:00.990
Her love for someone will open
a window to a new world.

00:46:01.960 --> 00:46:04.450
She's already started to feel that way.

00:46:04.570 --> 00:46:07.630
In the same way that your feelings
are starting to waver.

00:46:08.440 --> 00:46:15.030
Today, just a little, I could sense the time
that I had spent with Mr. Morisato.

00:46:16.140 --> 00:46:20.510
But still most of my memories seem
locked in a cloud.

00:46:20.950 --> 00:46:24.780
So then what is this feeling
that has been awakened...?

00:46:25.720 --> 00:46:28.380
I want to know more about this feeling.

00:46:29.260 --> 00:46:32.690
And about the other me,
that's sleeping inside myself.

00:46:37.700 --> 00:46:40.570
So it seems like her memories
are slowly starting to come back.

00:46:41.100 --> 00:46:43.300
What did he do to Belldandy?

00:46:43.870 --> 00:46:46.500
I don't know, exactly.

00:46:46.940 --> 00:46:50.770
But one thing's for sure;
her memories weren't erased.

00:46:51.580 --> 00:46:56.280
It's not like anyone can erase one's
memories, even in heaven.

00:46:56.520 --> 00:46:59.980
And even Celestin doesn't have
those powers.

00:47:00.820 --> 00:47:06.280
So if you can act as her stimulus,
the window to her heart should open.

00:47:06.560 --> 00:47:07.530
I'm sure.

00:47:13.070 --> 00:47:14.030
No!

00:47:14.230 --> 00:47:18.760
Celestin was the one who made me
forget about Mr. Morisato?!

00:47:19.810 --> 00:47:21.540
Why would he do that?!

00:48:11.660 --> 00:48:13.420
I'm glad you came.

00:48:20.830 --> 00:48:23.600
Why did you hide my memories?!

00:48:24.170 --> 00:48:27.940
You weren't the kind of person
who'd do something like that.

00:48:30.010 --> 00:48:34.470
My soul was chained in the silent,
frozen dungeon.

00:48:34.720 --> 00:48:37.480
In its solitude, I almost lost myself.

00:48:39.250 --> 00:48:42.250
But then, on the beautiful blue planet
that I could see from there...

00:48:42.320 --> 00:48:44.310
...I began to sense your presence.

00:48:44.420 --> 00:48:46.920
My heart had almost been sealed shut...

00:48:46.990 --> 00:48:50.090
...but your existence made me remember
something I had to do.

00:48:50.830 --> 00:48:54.820
The gods in heaven locked away things
that happened between you and me.

00:48:55.400 --> 00:48:58.130
Now, I'll show you everything.

00:48:58.210 --> 00:49:02.440
And I'll make you remember the truth
behind what I was trying to do.

00:49:26.400 --> 00:49:28.030
Look, Belldandy.

00:49:30.100 --> 00:49:31.330
What is it?

00:49:31.440 --> 00:49:34.370
You know the legend
of the Judgement Gate, don't you?

00:49:34.440 --> 00:49:35.370
Yes.

00:49:35.440 --> 00:49:38.610
Is that a model of the Judgement Gate?

00:49:40.310 --> 00:49:42.150
It's no model.

00:49:42.420 --> 00:49:43.750
That's the real thing.

00:49:49.490 --> 00:49:53.120
When someone from a world falls in love
with one living in another world...

00:49:53.190 --> 00:49:55.790
...they come here to test that love.

00:49:56.360 --> 00:49:58.960
The two must both pass through the gate.

00:49:59.070 --> 00:50:02.930
If there are any doubts or deception
in their hearts, the two will be torn apart.

00:50:03.200 --> 00:50:05.170
And they never meet again.

00:50:05.240 --> 00:50:07.800
If there is no disloyalty, they receive
the blessings of the gods.

00:50:08.840 --> 00:50:13.140
But no one has ever made it
safely through this gate.

00:50:13.210 --> 00:50:13.980
What?

00:50:14.050 --> 00:50:18.810
The gate exists to test people and
prevent worlds from achieving harmony.

00:50:19.290 --> 00:50:20.150
Then...!

00:50:28.530 --> 00:50:33.590
The gods have employed many methods
to test people since prehistoric ages.

00:50:34.640 --> 00:50:36.260
The system created by the gods...

00:50:36.340 --> 00:50:39.640
...divides every single person into
his living assignment in the world...

00:50:39.710 --> 00:50:42.440
...and determines his role, and controls it.

00:50:45.180 --> 00:50:49.240
The gods in heaven pretend not to see
the suffering of those people.

00:50:49.320 --> 00:50:50.370
And test them.

00:50:50.450 --> 00:50:53.110
Only the chosen ones are given a path.

00:50:53.620 --> 00:50:58.650
The sad voices of people born into this
world have pierced the depths of my heart.

00:50:59.330 --> 00:51:03.160
I want to do something to save them,
without discriminating against anyone!

00:51:03.630 --> 00:51:07.230
But the only way to do that
is to create a new system.

00:51:09.940 --> 00:51:13.340
Look, this was created by the gods!

00:51:13.970 --> 00:51:17.540
I cannot allow a system that gives
rise to such things!

00:51:27.450 --> 00:51:32.360
This is an expression of my will against
the present establishment in heaven.

00:51:38.070 --> 00:51:40.160
I want you to come with me.

00:51:41.270 --> 00:51:45.830
With your help, the wishes of the weak
will definitely come true.

00:51:46.470 --> 00:51:48.630
All people will be treated equally.

00:51:48.710 --> 00:51:52.610
I want to offer help to many
people who are suffering.

00:52:07.060 --> 00:52:08.490
Val Haid!

00:52:18.870 --> 00:52:19.860
No...

00:52:20.310 --> 00:52:22.430
Stop!!

00:52:39.260 --> 00:52:40.780
Come, Belldandy.

00:52:41.090 --> 00:52:43.760
Your only choice now is to come with me.

00:52:53.070 --> 00:52:54.040
Belldandy!

00:53:13.830 --> 00:53:17.420
It's hard to believe that a god
in the lowest seat...

00:53:17.500 --> 00:53:20.830
...in the Supreme Council of Heaven
would rebel against Yggdrasil.

00:53:21.670 --> 00:53:25.870
And you even made the divine protector
of time destroy herself.

00:53:27.140 --> 00:53:31.510
The sin you committed is not
to be taken lightly.

00:53:32.850 --> 00:53:37.750
Celestin, we will freeze your ability
to materialize your corporeal form...

00:53:37.850 --> 00:53:42.020
...and your soul will be sealed
in the Level 17 non-life form.

00:53:42.090 --> 00:53:45.020
You will be imprisoned for all eternity
on the face of the moon.

00:53:46.060 --> 00:53:52.430
We cannot afford to lose Belldandy,
one of our best goddesses.

00:53:53.230 --> 00:53:58.260
The things that happened will
be sealed as top secret.

00:53:58.340 --> 00:54:00.970
The incident will never be revealed.

00:54:05.310 --> 00:54:07.710
It's been a long time, Belldandy.

00:54:08.380 --> 00:54:10.710
I was told to give this to you.

00:54:13.550 --> 00:54:17.720
If you drink this, all your unhappy
thoughts will be forgotten.

00:54:42.250 --> 00:54:46.310
Belldandy, there's something I must tell you.

00:54:47.250 --> 00:54:51.950
An urgent matter came up and Celestin
had to suddenly depart for far away.

00:55:06.470 --> 00:55:08.770
Are you trying to make the same mistake?

00:55:09.140 --> 00:55:14.100
You, more than anyone, should understand
my ideas, and wish for their realization.

00:55:15.150 --> 00:55:17.840
I wish for no such thing!

00:55:25.930 --> 00:55:26.790
Belldandy!

00:55:26.860 --> 00:55:28.520
Move away from him!

00:55:55.490 --> 00:55:57.620
Don't harm Celestin.

00:56:12.910 --> 00:56:14.840
She should be around here somewhere.

00:56:15.880 --> 00:56:17.000
Over there!

00:56:17.540 --> 00:56:19.540
What the heck's going on?!

00:56:20.210 --> 00:56:21.580
Hey, wait!

00:56:21.950 --> 00:56:23.540
You're just a human!

00:56:23.620 --> 00:56:25.680
Do you think you can help?!

00:56:26.320 --> 00:56:29.690
Even if I am just a human,
there must be something I can do!

00:57:01.090 --> 00:57:02.380
Snap out of it!

00:57:02.720 --> 00:57:04.660
He'll only hurt you!

00:57:04.990 --> 00:57:07.790
You should be able to understand that now!

00:57:21.370 --> 00:57:22.310
Belldandy!

00:57:25.410 --> 00:57:26.570
What's happening?!

00:57:27.250 --> 00:57:29.240
She can't control her power!

00:57:29.380 --> 00:57:32.010
If she lashes out, all hell will break loose!

00:57:33.520 --> 00:57:34.490
Belldandy!

00:57:35.660 --> 00:57:37.250
Try to remember!

00:57:37.560 --> 00:57:41.390
When you and I listened to the wind,
it didn't sound sorrowful like this!

00:57:41.630 --> 00:57:42.750
Mr. Morisato...!

00:58:08.790 --> 00:58:14.850
I couldn't face up to the sadness,
and I locked you deep inside my heart.

00:58:15.830 --> 00:58:18.420
Give your sadness to me.

00:58:19.470 --> 00:58:22.960
And I'll give everything I have to you.

00:58:24.370 --> 00:58:26.770
Let's walk the future together.

00:58:42.520 --> 00:58:43.650
Ow...

00:58:57.670 --> 00:58:59.070
This is your fault...

00:58:59.840 --> 00:59:01.330
This is your fault...!

00:59:02.310 --> 00:59:03.610
Idiot!!

00:59:13.950 --> 00:59:15.110
Belldandy!

00:59:26.400 --> 00:59:27.260
Mr. Morisato!

00:59:27.900 --> 00:59:29.870
Mr. Morisato! Mr. Morisato!

00:59:30.600 --> 00:59:33.970
Sister, Mr. Morisato...!
Mr. Morisato is...!

00:59:41.480 --> 00:59:44.450
Now the gods will take action.

00:59:44.980 --> 00:59:46.850
And then it'll all be over.

00:59:47.420 --> 00:59:49.550
No, it'll be just the beginning.

01:00:05.510 --> 01:00:07.300
Well, that's a relief.

01:00:07.670 --> 01:00:12.010
Keiichi's lucky, having three goddesses
to look after him.

01:00:13.910 --> 01:00:14.880
Sister...

01:00:16.820 --> 01:00:19.380
I'm sorry for worrying you.

01:00:23.020 --> 01:00:25.010
Just get some rest.

01:00:31.730 --> 01:00:32.820
I'm sorry.

01:00:33.200 --> 01:00:36.430
This is all my fault for using my power.

01:00:41.940 --> 01:00:47.400
Skuld, let's return to heaven when
all this is over, shall we?

01:00:55.090 --> 01:00:59.460
I do nothing but make Mr. Morisato suffer!

01:01:00.730 --> 01:01:01.960
I can't even...

01:01:04.230 --> 01:01:05.220
Keiichi is...

01:01:06.300 --> 01:01:09.200
Keiichi is prepared for everything, I think.

01:01:11.500 --> 01:01:16.740
And I think you were, too, even
before you lost your memories of him.

01:01:17.310 --> 01:01:20.300
So many things happened since
you came to Earth.

01:01:20.580 --> 01:01:22.550
You met so many people.

01:01:22.820 --> 01:01:25.750
And Keiichi was always there by your side.

01:01:26.350 --> 01:01:29.290
The two of you used to smile
happily together.

01:01:34.190 --> 01:01:35.560
Don't give up, Sister.

01:01:36.030 --> 01:01:37.360
Once you get your memories back...

01:01:37.430 --> 01:01:39.330
...things will return to the way
they used to be!

01:01:39.400 --> 01:01:40.660
For sure!

01:01:44.670 --> 01:01:46.430
Thank you, Skuld.

01:01:46.570 --> 01:01:48.200
I'll try hard.

01:01:48.370 --> 01:01:51.430
I'll try hard and become myself again.

01:01:55.880 --> 01:01:57.010
Sister!

01:01:59.220 --> 01:02:03.450
She's all right. She's just tired
from overusing her power.

01:02:05.190 --> 01:02:06.350
Here, this is for you.

01:02:15.940 --> 01:02:17.330
The real me.

01:02:18.040 --> 01:02:20.700
The "me" who makes people happy.

01:02:21.440 --> 01:02:24.210
Celestin made me remember that.

01:02:25.240 --> 01:02:27.340
But the person I am now...

01:02:28.180 --> 01:02:29.550
My wishes...

01:02:44.400 --> 01:02:46.190
Keiichi?

01:02:46.270 --> 01:02:47.430
This is Hasegawa.

01:02:47.500 --> 01:02:51.230
We found a BMW valve,
and I have it now.

01:02:51.470 --> 01:02:52.870
Okay, thanks.

01:02:56.310 --> 01:02:58.330
I'm dropping by the club then going home.

01:02:58.410 --> 01:02:59.810
Take care of the rest, okay?

01:03:01.180 --> 01:03:07.950
Um... even if she loses her memories,
nothing will change between you two, right?

01:03:11.060 --> 01:03:12.020
Right.

01:03:26.370 --> 01:03:27.100
Morgan!

01:03:27.670 --> 01:03:29.570
Where'd this blood come from?

01:03:31.540 --> 01:03:32.740
What happened?!

01:03:38.420 --> 01:03:40.410
You seem to be all right.

01:03:42.790 --> 01:03:45.690
Forget me; you've got to worry about yourself.

01:03:46.230 --> 01:03:47.190
That's okay...

01:03:49.030 --> 01:03:50.960
Let's go to the medical room.

01:03:51.430 --> 01:03:53.920
Are you worried about me?

01:03:54.500 --> 01:03:56.590
That's not the important thing here!

01:03:57.400 --> 01:03:58.460
Hurry!

01:04:17.360 --> 01:04:19.480
I'll just put on a bandage,
then you go to the hospital.

01:04:22.430 --> 01:04:24.120
That's serious!

01:04:32.210 --> 01:04:33.070
Sorry.

01:04:35.540 --> 01:04:38.070
I used to have someone I loved.

01:04:38.680 --> 01:04:41.440
But we were forced to stay apart.

01:04:42.950 --> 01:04:46.850
I feel funny seeing the two of you together.

01:04:48.050 --> 01:04:53.690
Maybe you two can overcome
the obstacles that I couldn't.

01:04:54.990 --> 01:04:56.930
I can't stand the thought of that.

01:04:57.230 --> 01:04:59.860
Because that'll make my relationship
seem insignificant.

01:05:00.870 --> 01:05:04.830
But what I'm trying to do
seems to result in quite the opposite.

01:05:05.170 --> 01:05:07.330
It's like I'm helping you and Belldandy.

01:05:08.170 --> 01:05:10.870
Why... what for...?

01:05:12.550 --> 01:05:14.270
I don't know anymore.

01:05:16.450 --> 01:05:17.280
Morgan...

01:05:17.920 --> 01:05:21.720
If this world were to change,
would you fall in love with me?

01:05:22.690 --> 01:05:24.990
Would you make my dream come true?

01:05:26.830 --> 01:05:30.920
I'm not really following you,
but I can tell you've been hurt.

01:05:33.170 --> 01:05:37.000
Still, it's not something material
that you want, right?

01:05:41.510 --> 01:05:44.840
Belldandy will become Celestin's girl
no matter what you do.

01:05:45.180 --> 01:05:47.200
And you'll be left alone.

01:05:47.780 --> 01:05:49.410
What are you talking about?

01:05:50.180 --> 01:05:51.910
The world is about to change.

01:05:52.990 --> 01:05:54.750
That's why I've come here.

01:05:55.150 --> 01:05:57.880
And this is my new start...

01:06:12.670 --> 01:06:15.510
Are you the one who erased
Belldandy's memories?!

01:06:19.350 --> 01:06:20.330
Morgan!

01:06:23.080 --> 01:06:24.050
Wait!

01:06:29.590 --> 01:06:30.560
Emergency!

01:06:30.620 --> 01:06:33.590
The virus has multiplied!
It's invaded Areas E and G!

01:06:33.660 --> 01:06:35.020
We can't build the barrier in time!

01:06:35.090 --> 01:06:37.060
Switching to emergency system!

01:06:37.400 --> 01:06:38.800
The virus made it through!

01:06:39.000 --> 01:06:43.900
Peorth, at this rate, 20% of the heavenly
system will be shut down!

01:06:43.970 --> 01:06:46.300
This might affect Earth as well!

01:06:46.370 --> 01:06:48.970
As long as the system has
a direct connection with Belldandy...

01:06:49.040 --> 01:06:53.600
...we won't be able to stop it from spreading
unless we eradicate the virus' main body!

01:06:54.450 --> 01:06:55.780
Prepare for injection.

01:06:56.220 --> 01:06:57.180
What?!

01:06:57.650 --> 01:06:59.410
You don't mean...

01:06:59.490 --> 01:07:01.780
Standard measures won't work anymore.

01:07:03.160 --> 01:07:07.650
We'll give Belldandy a vaccination
before this problem affects the Earth.

01:07:11.330 --> 01:07:12.300
Yes?

01:07:14.070 --> 01:07:14.790
What?!

01:07:18.040 --> 01:07:19.000
Belldandy!

01:07:19.440 --> 01:07:21.130
That's too dangerous!

01:07:21.310 --> 01:07:22.640
You know that!

01:07:22.710 --> 01:07:25.970
The probability of it working is only 16%!

01:07:26.610 --> 01:07:30.810
Of course it's too hard seeing Keiichi
and Belldandy like this!

01:07:30.880 --> 01:07:33.580
But if this doesn't work,
not only her memories of Keiichi...

01:07:34.050 --> 01:07:37.490
...but her memories of us and those in
heaven will completely vanish, too!

01:07:38.020 --> 01:07:40.490
I don't want that to happen!

01:07:41.330 --> 01:07:44.850
If that's the only solution, then let us be,
the way things are!

01:07:47.270 --> 01:07:49.460
The vaccination is what I think, right?

01:07:49.970 --> 01:07:50.960
Yes.

01:07:51.100 --> 01:07:53.370
It'll completely wipe out the virus.

01:07:53.910 --> 01:07:56.970
But there's a high possibility
that it will leave side effects.

01:07:57.080 --> 01:07:58.440
So in other words...

01:07:58.810 --> 01:08:00.750
It'll become a blank slate.

01:08:00.810 --> 01:08:07.050
The risk is so great that this treatment
hasn't been used for hundreds of years.

01:08:16.400 --> 01:08:19.460
Morgan's on Celestin's side, it turns out.

01:08:20.070 --> 01:08:24.030
Maybe she has what it takes
to give you back your memories.

01:08:24.940 --> 01:08:28.500
So maybe you don't need
that dangerous vaccination...

01:08:28.570 --> 01:08:31.510
I'm going to take the vaccination.

01:08:31.940 --> 01:08:35.710
- Belldandy...
- She and you were kissing, weren't you.

01:08:36.950 --> 01:08:38.250
That was just...

01:08:38.520 --> 01:08:42.420
Sorry, I didn't mean to bring it up.

01:08:43.190 --> 01:08:46.990
It's just that I couldn't hold my feelings in.

01:08:48.090 --> 01:08:51.620
I felt insecure and I thought my heart
was going to be torn apart.

01:08:52.300 --> 01:08:54.060
So I ran away.

01:08:55.600 --> 01:08:59.830
I came here to make your wish come true.

01:09:00.540 --> 01:09:08.740
But there's also an ugly part of me
that wants you to love no one but myself.

01:09:14.220 --> 01:09:18.450
Could you love me despite that?

01:09:20.130 --> 01:09:22.460
I love you because of that.

01:09:23.000 --> 01:09:25.360
Thank you, Mr. Morisato.

01:09:25.900 --> 01:09:28.130
I'm going to take my chances.

01:09:28.330 --> 01:09:30.930
Even if my chances are only 16%...

01:09:32.000 --> 01:09:34.630
If it can make me be like I used to...

01:09:35.510 --> 01:09:37.040
- Then even...
- I...

01:09:38.010 --> 01:09:41.240
Even if you completely lost the memory
of the time we spent together...

01:09:42.050 --> 01:09:44.610
...even if we ended up
on other sides of the universe...

01:09:45.580 --> 01:09:48.420
...I'd find you and we'd start all over again.

01:09:49.020 --> 01:09:50.650
Again and again.

01:09:50.720 --> 01:09:52.780
No matter how many years it took.

01:09:55.730 --> 01:09:57.420
Thank you.

01:10:35.900 --> 01:10:37.530
Vaccination on standby.

01:10:37.800 --> 01:10:40.030
Granting access over Peorth.

01:10:40.810 --> 01:10:43.210
I will make this work.

01:10:44.440 --> 01:10:48.170
Break the veil of the darkness,
and cast off the evil future.

01:10:48.580 --> 01:10:51.180
Oh great one that brings wind
back to the Earth.

01:10:54.920 --> 01:10:56.550
Contact established with Belldandy!

01:11:01.160 --> 01:11:03.190
Hold on to the light of hope.

01:11:03.530 --> 01:11:05.550
Send them, who nest in the large tree...

01:11:05.630 --> 01:11:08.790
...and cast shadows between the past,
present and future...

01:11:08.870 --> 01:11:10.700
...back to the world without light.

01:11:13.970 --> 01:11:15.870
Virus substance located!

01:11:20.080 --> 01:11:22.380
That's... the virus...

01:11:23.120 --> 01:11:25.020
Schubert De Libertine!

01:11:27.720 --> 01:11:28.710
Here it comes.

01:11:35.660 --> 01:11:37.090
What is that?

01:11:38.030 --> 01:11:39.290
Something's wrong!

01:11:39.370 --> 01:11:40.390
What's the matter?

01:11:41.570 --> 01:11:43.800
The virus has consumed the vaccination...

01:11:43.870 --> 01:11:46.360
...and it has been converted
to another program!

01:11:46.870 --> 01:11:47.700
Oh no!

01:11:48.540 --> 01:11:50.170
Was this its goal?!

01:11:57.650 --> 01:11:58.670
What is it?

01:11:59.420 --> 01:12:00.780
Are you okay?!

01:12:12.300 --> 01:12:14.730
Someone's hacked into the main system!

01:12:15.170 --> 01:12:18.800
The altered program has started
decoding the passwords!

01:12:18.870 --> 01:12:21.570
It's getting through all the protectors!

01:12:21.670 --> 01:12:23.070
Where's it headed?!

01:12:23.140 --> 01:12:24.800
To the top secret program!

01:13:17.900 --> 01:13:18.860
Celestin...

01:13:19.600 --> 01:13:21.570
So this was your purpose.

01:13:21.830 --> 01:13:23.860
You just used their feelings.

01:13:24.800 --> 01:13:29.500
You created a program that would
get past Yggdrasil's system protectors...

01:13:29.580 --> 01:13:33.340
...using Belldandy's emotional waves,
and the vaccination that added to it.

01:13:34.050 --> 01:13:37.020
You even went that far...

01:13:38.250 --> 01:13:42.410
I did it all to destroy the world
that is shut tight!

01:13:58.600 --> 01:14:02.040
A large energy field is
building around the residence!

01:14:02.510 --> 01:14:04.240
It's very powerful!

01:14:06.750 --> 01:14:08.210
I can't stop it!

01:14:08.350 --> 01:14:09.970
More importantly, what about Belldandy?!

01:14:10.050 --> 01:14:11.780
What's happening to Belldandy?!

01:14:12.380 --> 01:14:14.880
The system's in such a mess, I can't tell!

01:14:15.450 --> 01:14:17.080
It's materializing!

01:14:40.810 --> 01:14:42.210
Wh-what the...?

01:15:00.370 --> 01:15:02.630
Awaken, Belldandy.

01:15:03.840 --> 01:15:06.830
The time has finally come.

01:15:20.020 --> 01:15:24.850
It's very exciting that you've
become her instructor, Celestin.

01:15:25.360 --> 01:15:28.760
She's very important in heaven.

01:15:30.360 --> 01:15:33.890
I truly want her to become a lady
with a beautiful heart.

01:15:34.730 --> 01:15:36.130
Belldandy!

01:15:36.440 --> 01:15:37.400
Belldandy!

01:15:40.110 --> 01:15:41.440
Is something the matter?

01:15:42.210 --> 01:15:44.800
Oh my, there's Belldandy.

01:15:53.420 --> 01:15:55.220
It's nice to meet you, Belldandy.

01:15:55.590 --> 01:15:56.990
I'm Celestin.

01:15:57.390 --> 01:16:00.520
Nice to meet you, Mr. Celestin.

01:16:03.500 --> 01:16:05.690
Why are you crying?

01:16:08.000 --> 01:16:09.430
This little bird...

01:16:18.580 --> 01:16:19.540
Wow!

01:16:25.550 --> 01:16:27.850
Thank you, Mr. Celestin.

01:16:28.420 --> 01:16:31.790
You don't need to call me "Mr."
Just call me Celestin.

01:16:32.720 --> 01:16:35.590
With the light of hopes
that shines on trees...

01:16:35.590 --> 01:16:42.360
...I, Celestin, hereby promise to stay
with you until the day you leave the nest.

01:16:51.710 --> 01:16:53.470
I found you, Belldandy.

01:16:53.950 --> 01:16:55.240
Come on out.

01:16:59.550 --> 01:17:03.890
Urd can't find me,
but you always find me right away.

01:17:04.590 --> 01:17:05.920
How come?

01:17:06.490 --> 01:17:10.360
That's because I'm always thinking
about you.

01:17:11.130 --> 01:17:14.390
I know everything you think, you know.

01:17:15.000 --> 01:17:20.500
So no matter where you hide,
I'll always find you right away.

01:17:21.470 --> 01:17:22.670
Know what?

01:17:22.740 --> 01:17:25.440
This tree doesn't look very happy.

01:17:25.640 --> 01:17:27.540
Make it better, okay?

01:17:27.910 --> 01:17:31.140
I'd rather hear you sing a song for it.

01:17:31.950 --> 01:17:33.110
A song?

01:17:33.190 --> 01:17:37.450
Yes, sing a song with the thought
that you want to make this tree better.

01:17:37.520 --> 01:17:38.450
Okay!

01:18:13.290 --> 01:18:14.490
Bell... dandy...

01:18:31.840 --> 01:18:33.470
Did you fall asleep?

01:18:34.380 --> 01:18:36.940
Hurry and grow up, Belldandy.

01:18:42.320 --> 01:18:44.880
You've worked at this for many years.
Well done.

01:18:44.960 --> 01:18:48.410
You've raised a beautiful
and gentle goddess.

01:18:49.130 --> 01:18:55.290
She will be placed in the Goddess Relief
Office, and will study other worlds.

01:18:55.370 --> 01:18:59.570
The world is full of suffering and sadness.

01:19:00.870 --> 01:19:04.310
Much of what you see will hurt you deeply.

01:19:04.640 --> 01:19:07.370
You won't be able to retain your innocence.

01:19:07.750 --> 01:19:11.200
The world must be reborn.

01:19:21.390 --> 01:19:22.720
Mr. Morisato...

01:19:24.500 --> 01:19:30.560
I will bring my memories of you
back to me at any cost.

01:19:31.670 --> 01:19:35.160
Belldandy, It's me.
Do you recognize me?

01:19:35.770 --> 01:19:37.940
I know. You're...

01:19:39.850 --> 01:19:40.810
You're...

01:19:47.620 --> 01:19:49.950
What's this tree doing here on Earth?!

01:19:50.560 --> 01:19:52.850
I found it, with your help.

01:19:53.290 --> 01:19:55.420
The energy in the tree gives me the power...

01:19:55.490 --> 01:20:00.800
...to go through the barrier in heaven
that I could not overcome.

01:20:01.370 --> 01:20:05.330
Now no one else will have to suffer,
not even Morgan...

01:20:06.340 --> 01:20:07.830
You, either, Belldandy...

01:20:07.940 --> 01:20:14.210
The life forms on Earth have evolved over
many years, and that's not what they desire!

01:20:14.950 --> 01:20:19.350
They're filled with happiness because they
make an effort to live and to mature!

01:20:19.890 --> 01:20:25.790
And even though they age, they learn to
have joy, be sad, and love in the process!

01:20:26.060 --> 01:20:29.120
I've seen many cases of such happiness
here on Earth!

01:20:31.030 --> 01:20:36.130
All you want is the kind of maturity where
you turn the hands of time forward.

01:20:36.640 --> 01:20:40.470
I understand why the gods
sent you here to Earth.

01:20:41.170 --> 01:20:47.810
But can you also love the sickness
and death that run rampant in this world?

01:20:48.180 --> 01:20:52.140
For Earth's life forms to advance that far
they need over tens of thousands of years!

01:20:52.220 --> 01:20:54.980
During that time more and more
suffering ones will appear.

01:20:55.420 --> 01:20:57.820
I can't stand by and watch that!

01:20:58.260 --> 01:21:00.320
I can't wait for that long!

01:21:04.800 --> 01:21:07.160
Celestin! Please, don't!

01:21:12.440 --> 01:21:16.430
You can't possibly understand
how I felt before!

01:21:17.380 --> 01:21:21.680
One day you'll have to face
the Judgement Gate yourself.

01:21:22.450 --> 01:21:24.470
You think you can make it through?!

01:21:24.550 --> 01:21:26.850
Do you have confidence that you
won't lose your lover?!

01:21:27.720 --> 01:21:30.350
If we believe in each other...

01:21:44.300 --> 01:21:45.790
What is this thing?!

01:21:56.180 --> 01:21:57.440
That program...

01:21:59.220 --> 01:21:59.880
Belldandy!

01:22:00.450 --> 01:22:02.110
What? Sister?!

01:22:04.190 --> 01:22:07.280
You should understand,
if you see things through your eyes.

01:22:19.910 --> 01:22:22.000
The final program is booting up.

01:22:22.370 --> 01:22:24.070
Can't you stop it?!

01:22:24.510 --> 01:22:27.540
The system isn't functioning
with all the damage from the virus.

01:22:29.050 --> 01:22:31.410
We have to do something about
that monster.

01:22:31.850 --> 01:22:33.080
Let's go, Skuld!

01:22:33.150 --> 01:22:35.020
Huh?! But what about Sister?!

01:22:35.520 --> 01:22:37.820
We'll let her take care of Celestin.

01:22:38.090 --> 01:22:40.960
Let's just do what we're able to!

01:22:41.690 --> 01:22:42.990
Hey, wait!

01:22:56.880 --> 01:23:01.810
Mr. Morisato, Hasegawa,
Chihiro, Tamiya and the others...

01:23:02.550 --> 01:23:07.110
They're getting all they can out of life,
and they've found their dreams.

01:23:07.690 --> 01:23:10.660
The future isn't something handed
to you on a platter.

01:23:11.120 --> 01:23:15.790
Mr. Morisato and I want to live
on our own strengths, too.

01:23:16.700 --> 01:23:21.290
Even though there are different worlds,
I'm sure we'd all still feel the same way.

01:23:22.670 --> 01:23:26.070
I'm Belldandy, the Goddess First Class
with no restrictions.

01:23:26.240 --> 01:23:29.730
I must work for the pride and dignity
of the life forms here on Earth!

01:23:30.840 --> 01:23:31.810
Celestin!

01:23:32.140 --> 01:23:33.700
I'll stop you for certain!

01:23:41.350 --> 01:23:42.820
I said we'd stop it, but...

01:23:44.560 --> 01:23:45.990
In that case...

01:23:46.360 --> 01:23:50.760
Spirit of Thunder, who races in the sky,
and shakes the ground and the air!

01:23:51.160 --> 01:23:53.230
- With your great power...
- U-Urd!

01:23:53.770 --> 01:23:56.670
An enormous magical field
is forming at the site!

01:23:57.370 --> 01:24:01.640
Become thunderbolts in my hand,
you the power that smashes everything!

01:24:08.480 --> 01:24:10.110
Destructive, booming thunder!

01:24:20.760 --> 01:24:22.750
Does it have a magical decomposition
program?

01:24:32.570 --> 01:24:36.340
Why are you helping him,
Morgan the fairy princess?!

01:24:37.980 --> 01:24:40.880
The gods think only of themselves.

01:24:41.910 --> 01:24:44.710
I won't have my hopes stolen
from me any longer!

01:24:45.420 --> 01:24:46.350
Hopes?

01:24:46.420 --> 01:24:47.750
Give me a break!

01:24:47.820 --> 01:24:50.950
What you're about to open up
is a Pandora's box.

01:24:51.020 --> 01:24:52.750
A place devoid of the light of hopes!

01:24:53.060 --> 01:24:56.080
Stop thinking you're the only one
who's suffering!

01:24:56.830 --> 01:24:59.390
I want all this to happen!

01:25:01.030 --> 01:25:03.060
Do you actually believe that?!

01:25:26.460 --> 01:25:27.650
Peorth!

01:25:27.730 --> 01:25:30.320
A high level of energy is starting
to pour into the Earth!

01:25:37.270 --> 01:25:38.240
At this rate...

01:25:38.300 --> 01:25:41.760
...Earth's life forms will receive a high
dimensional energy outflow at once...

01:25:41.840 --> 01:25:43.170
...from thousands of years in the future!

01:25:43.240 --> 01:25:45.770
And they won't be able to maintain
their current ecological system!

01:25:46.080 --> 01:25:47.140
How terrible...

01:25:48.980 --> 01:25:52.350
Why do the gods give people trials?

01:25:52.980 --> 01:25:57.220
Is it not our mission to guide them?

01:25:58.320 --> 01:25:59.310
Celestin!

01:26:04.400 --> 01:26:05.520
Belldandy.

01:26:06.770 --> 01:26:09.130
I'm ordering you, as a Goddess First Class.

01:26:09.200 --> 01:26:11.690
Stop this program!

01:26:12.700 --> 01:26:15.700
Are you saying my ideas are mistaken?

01:26:16.340 --> 01:26:18.400
Your method is mistaken!

01:26:18.680 --> 01:26:24.380
Do you have any idea what effect all this
energy will have on Earth's life forms?!

01:26:24.580 --> 01:26:26.520
There are no other means!

01:26:27.390 --> 01:26:29.820
The gods have created the world this way.

01:26:29.890 --> 01:26:32.760
The only way I can change it
is with my power!

01:26:33.360 --> 01:26:35.420
People will all become equally happy.

01:26:35.590 --> 01:26:38.560
You must hope for the same thing!

01:26:39.600 --> 01:26:42.760
I'm simply trying to correct
the mistake of the gods!

01:26:43.540 --> 01:26:44.500
You're wrong!

01:26:48.770 --> 01:26:53.010
Why... why did you start to think that way?!

01:26:53.550 --> 01:26:57.950
You're the one who taught me
that life was precious!

01:26:58.520 --> 01:27:02.350
I want to grow old with the lives
here on Earth!

01:27:03.050 --> 01:27:04.450
That's why...

01:27:04.520 --> 01:27:06.680
I'm going to protect this world!

01:27:07.330 --> 01:27:10.850
Even if the Judgement Gate
appears before us?

01:27:13.500 --> 01:27:15.470
The values are rapidly increasing!

01:27:16.030 --> 01:27:17.830
Reaching critical state!

01:27:18.340 --> 01:27:19.930
What about restoring Yggdrasil?

01:27:20.210 --> 01:27:21.930
It's going to be a while yet.

01:27:26.880 --> 01:27:28.740
This isn't working at all!

01:27:28.880 --> 01:27:30.180
In that case...

01:27:42.860 --> 01:27:45.890
If our faith in one another
falters even slightly...

01:27:46.630 --> 01:27:48.930
...you will lose him forever.

01:27:49.770 --> 01:27:52.290
I don't want to see you unhappy.

01:27:53.500 --> 01:27:58.000
But in the new world,
that won't be an issue any longer.

01:27:59.680 --> 01:28:02.200
You will be needed there.

01:28:03.010 --> 01:28:05.780
As a symbol to guide the new start to life.

01:28:06.020 --> 01:28:08.080
I want you to be by my side.

01:28:08.320 --> 01:28:09.410
Stop it!

01:28:14.130 --> 01:28:16.860
Please, accept that you're mistaken!

01:28:17.530 --> 01:28:19.890
I'm trying to prove that I'm not!

01:28:20.600 --> 01:28:24.430
The current system can't stop
the huge flow of energy!

01:28:24.740 --> 01:28:28.000
Yggdrasil's is 4.78% restored!

01:28:28.070 --> 01:28:30.630
The energy outflow is over 30%!

01:28:30.980 --> 01:28:38.640
5.02% restored... 5.06%,
5.08%... 5.12%...

01:28:39.720 --> 01:28:42.480
Ere, shut down all the lines.

01:28:43.090 --> 01:28:45.280
And terminate all the running programs.

01:28:46.390 --> 01:28:49.550
Yggdrasil, authorize Goddess First Class,
Peorth.

01:28:49.690 --> 01:28:51.030
Authorized.

01:28:54.300 --> 01:28:56.200
Commanding activation of Gungnir.

01:28:56.400 --> 01:28:58.130
Command confirmed.

01:28:58.300 --> 01:28:59.360
Take aim.

01:28:59.440 --> 01:29:00.770
Taking aim.

01:29:01.010 --> 01:29:02.470
But what about Celestin...!

01:29:03.940 --> 01:29:05.140
Unlocking...

01:29:05.710 --> 01:29:07.700
After the programs are terminated...

01:29:07.780 --> 01:29:11.110
...we'll use every function in heaven
to recover the energy.

01:29:19.320 --> 01:29:20.220
The gate...?

01:29:27.770 --> 01:29:30.060
Removal of the final lock confirmed.

01:29:30.870 --> 01:29:35.070
This is all that is left for us.

01:29:43.110 --> 01:29:46.950
Just when I'm trying to show you
the world that the gods wished for...

01:29:47.020 --> 01:29:48.280
...why do you stop me?!

01:29:48.350 --> 01:29:51.190
Why waste time and make people
suffer?

01:29:51.860 --> 01:29:54.520
Belldandy will suffer, as well.

01:29:56.130 --> 01:30:00.430
You people are using your powers
to protect this era as well.

01:30:06.840 --> 01:30:10.040
Heaven and Celestin, why are you both...

01:30:10.310 --> 01:30:11.280
Belldandy!

01:30:14.010 --> 01:30:18.070
Why do you try to use your powers
to solve everything?

01:30:18.250 --> 01:30:22.480
Our powers exist to protect those we love!

01:30:23.090 --> 01:30:27.020
Even if my body is torn apart...
Even if it costs my life...!

01:30:28.260 --> 01:30:32.390
Belldandy, I don't know what's right.

01:30:32.800 --> 01:30:35.430
But no matter what world
we're talking about...

01:30:35.500 --> 01:30:37.990
...that world has no meaning
for me without you in it.

01:30:38.070 --> 01:30:39.630
I know you feel the same, Celestin.

01:30:39.700 --> 01:30:43.140
Remember the light of the hopes
you've seen inside, Belldandy.

01:30:43.370 --> 01:30:46.040
Remember the world you've spent time in!

01:30:46.240 --> 01:30:47.970
The hopes you've fostered!

01:30:54.890 --> 01:30:57.650
Even if the gods are turned to enemies...

01:30:57.720 --> 01:31:00.420
...I'll keep on protecting you.

01:31:01.330 --> 01:31:05.160
My beloved Keiichi...

01:31:06.030 --> 01:31:10.020
Celestin, lend me your powers!

01:31:28.590 --> 01:31:29.610
That's...

01:31:35.260 --> 01:31:37.820
Gungnir has disappeared...

01:31:49.110 --> 01:31:50.510
Shooting stars...

01:31:55.410 --> 01:31:56.380
Keiichi!

01:32:10.430 --> 01:32:11.990
The Judgement Gate.

01:32:14.100 --> 01:32:16.030
Celestin told me about it.

01:32:18.540 --> 01:32:21.840
We've come this far.

01:32:25.210 --> 01:32:25.970
Right?

01:32:28.150 --> 01:32:30.340
Yes, Keiichi.

01:32:33.780 --> 01:32:34.650
Why...

01:32:35.820 --> 01:32:37.620
Why am I...

01:32:38.760 --> 01:32:41.350
What are you suggesting I do here, now?

01:32:42.530 --> 01:32:44.830
There's no one here that I love.

01:32:50.030 --> 01:32:54.330
It's not like you don't know
what this gate is.

01:32:55.110 --> 01:32:56.070
Right.

01:32:56.410 --> 01:32:58.670
If you have even the slightest
deception in your heart...

01:32:59.240 --> 01:33:01.840
Then we'll be separated forever, right?

01:33:02.450 --> 01:33:05.610
Of course, Belldandy and I
are afraid of the consequences.

01:33:06.480 --> 01:33:09.040
Still, I don't want to let go of her hand.

01:33:09.450 --> 01:33:11.510
I want to live together with her.

01:33:12.420 --> 01:33:13.720
That's why I...

01:33:47.060 --> 01:33:49.420
Isn't this clear enough as an answer?

01:33:50.600 --> 01:33:53.930
People have the strength
to overcome their obstacles...

01:33:54.170 --> 01:33:55.600
Probably everyone...

01:33:56.270 --> 01:34:00.230
I knew I didn't believe in myself.

01:34:01.170 --> 01:34:07.440
I was afraid that even if there were no gate,
some day we would go our separate ways.

01:34:09.310 --> 01:34:13.220
But what really matters is living
in the present.

01:34:13.750 --> 01:34:17.880
Believing in the future. Maybe you can...

01:34:20.790 --> 01:34:25.290
I have just seen my past in you...

01:34:26.300 --> 01:34:28.200
I will stay here.

01:34:28.500 --> 01:34:32.030
If some lovers come here in the future...

01:34:32.340 --> 01:34:36.640
...I'll tell them that people like you
were once here.

01:34:41.680 --> 01:34:43.310
The last branch!

01:34:44.450 --> 01:34:46.280
It's all over now!

01:34:50.120 --> 01:34:51.950
Can't you do anything?

01:34:52.560 --> 01:34:56.650
Keiichi, you told me to never give up.

01:35:01.530 --> 01:35:03.090
I'll be back.

01:35:05.840 --> 01:35:08.030
Urd! Skuld!

01:35:09.140 --> 01:35:10.370
Sister!

01:35:11.540 --> 01:35:12.840
Thank goodness!

01:35:13.280 --> 01:35:15.340
Sorry I've worried you, sister!

01:35:16.110 --> 01:35:17.910
I'm glad you've returned.

01:35:19.450 --> 01:35:20.850
But now...

01:35:22.950 --> 01:35:24.680
Is there no hope?

01:35:24.920 --> 01:35:25.950
There is.

01:35:26.390 --> 01:35:29.520
This world isn't that weak.

01:35:29.960 --> 01:35:34.920
It has the power to live life to its fullest,
and the power to carry on into the future.

01:35:36.230 --> 01:35:40.170
All we need to do is support it
the best we can.

01:35:40.770 --> 01:35:46.970
The feeling of loving someone
brings powers to us goddesses.

01:36:06.130 --> 01:36:22.440
Happiness is sharing with friends

01:36:06.130 --> 01:36:22.440
Felicitas cum amicis communicata est

01:36:22.810 --> 01:36:40.070
Saddness is the pain shared with all your friends

01:36:22.810 --> 01:36:40.070
Tristitia est communis dolor cum omnibus amicis

01:36:37.530 --> 01:36:40.050
An unknown program is running now.

01:36:40.110 --> 01:36:48.320
Through the rough life is happiness

01:36:40.110 --> 01:36:48.320
Per aspera vita beata

01:36:48.320 --> 01:36:55.680
A reason to live

01:36:48.320 --> 01:36:55.680
Causa vivendi

01:36:55.680 --> 01:37:04.780
To find a great moment is to believe

01:36:55.680 --> 01:37:04.780
In venire credere magni momenti

01:37:04.780 --> 01:37:12.850
Love and hope

01:37:04.780 --> 01:37:12.850
Amoris speique!

01:37:13.200 --> 01:37:21.360
The gate is open

01:37:13.200 --> 01:37:21.360
Fores aperiendi

01:37:21.530 --> 01:37:30.720
It is time...

01:37:21.530 --> 01:37:30.720
Tempus est...

01:37:34.240 --> 01:37:42.570
Certainly

01:37:34.240 --> 01:37:42.570
Certe

01:37:48.570 --> 01:37:50.330
Now we can have ourselves a rest!

01:37:50.400 --> 01:37:51.800
To the hot springs!

01:37:51.870 --> 01:37:53.930
I'm going shopping at the Goddess Mall!

01:37:54.000 --> 01:37:55.530
H-Hey everybody!

01:37:55.610 --> 01:37:59.340
We still have to check for bugs
and do all kinds of other work!

01:37:59.880 --> 01:38:02.140
Yes, we know!

01:38:06.450 --> 01:38:07.640
And now...

01:38:11.390 --> 01:38:17.020
Many people will probably be hurt
and suffer, from this point on as well.

01:38:17.600 --> 01:38:20.030
But we're no different.

01:38:21.400 --> 01:38:28.030
But loving people, and learning from
the past and living life earnestly...

01:38:28.510 --> 01:38:32.470
...is the key to a wonderful future,
I believe.

01:38:33.540 --> 01:38:40.140
Heaven has granted my selfish wish
to stay here by Keiichi's side.

01:38:40.750 --> 01:38:46.780
I believe that we're close to the entrance
to the world that you dream of.

01:38:47.760 --> 01:38:51.720
I love this world where Keiichi was born.

01:38:52.760 --> 01:38:57.460
Perhaps you two have taken the first step
down the road that heaven pointed to.

01:39:04.310 --> 01:39:07.240
I wasn't a good instructor.

01:39:07.650 --> 01:39:11.050
But Earth has raised you
into a wonderful goddess.

01:39:12.220 --> 01:39:20.520
If you truly think so, then it's all due to you,
and Keiichi, and many other people.

01:39:22.790 --> 01:39:24.990
You haven't changed; quick to cry.

01:39:28.970 --> 01:39:30.660
Thank you, Belldandy.

01:39:31.870 --> 01:39:34.600
I'm glad I could hear you singing
one last time.

01:39:35.110 --> 01:39:38.470
I'll always be praying for your happiness.

01:39:45.580 --> 01:39:49.610
Celestin really was a wonderful
instructor to me.

01:39:50.720 --> 01:39:52.690
Yes, and now it's all over.

01:39:53.190 --> 01:39:58.630
Yes, but there's still one side effect
from the virus.

01:39:59.000 --> 01:39:59.790
What?

01:40:00.830 --> 01:40:04.160
Our contract was revoked.

01:40:05.000 --> 01:40:09.630
So now I can grant you one new wish.

01:40:11.180 --> 01:40:13.140
That's easy to decide.

01:40:22.220 --> 01:40:23.480
Oh, boy.

01:40:24.220 --> 01:40:27.490
Well, another happy ending.

01:40:28.430 --> 01:40:32.160
I wish I could be in love like Sister...!

01:40:33.200 --> 01:40:34.990
You're about 100 years too early.

